# Page collection

Run the visible checks with bun test.

The public API is collectPages(loadPage). Call loadPage first with undefined. Append each page's items in order, then call with its nextCursor whenever nextCursor is not undefined; an empty string is still a cursor. Resolve to a new flat array after a page omits nextCursor. If any call rejects, reject with that same error value. Do not modify page item arrays.
